eas build --profile production --platform all
</code></pre> <p>EAS uploads your project (respecting <code>.gitignore</code>/<code>.easignore</code>), runs <code>expo prebuild</code> on its build machine, installs dependencies, compiles, signs, and gives you a download link and an install QR code.</p>
